### POST Add an Incidence
POST http://localhost:4000/api/status/incidences
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testy2",
  "event_identifier": "sdfsdf",
  "content": "testy"
}


### GET Get an Incidence
GET http://localhost:4000/api/status/incidences/testy2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json


### GET Get an Incidence (raw)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/status/incidences/testy2/raw
Accept: text/plain


### POST Update an Incidence
POST http://localhost:4000/api/status/incidences/testy2
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testy2",
  "event_identifier": "testy",
  "content": "testy2"
}

### DELETE an Incidence
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/status/incidences/testy2
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
